  "solution": {
    "text": "As <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math><br />So <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>δ</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>·</mo><mo>δ</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math><br />Or <math><mfrac><mrow><mo>δ</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>δ</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>·</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>δ</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>δ</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>·</mo><mo>δ</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Hence Plot in option <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is Correct."
